{"question_text": {"Anatomy-1": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) In developed colder countries geriatric age group is-", "option1": "ক) 60+", "option2": "খ) 65+ ", "option3": "গ) 55+", "option4": "ঘ) 50+", "answer": "2", "exp": ""}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) How many types of ameloblastoma histologically??", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 3", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 5", "answer": "2", "exp": ""}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) Following which cyst is inflammatory cyst??", "option1": "ক) dentigerous cyst", "option2": "খ) eruption cyst", "option3": "গ) radicular cyst", "option4": "ঘ) odontogebic keratocyst", "answer": "3", "exp": ""}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) Following which is not a type of tooth movement??", "option1": "ক) tipping", "option2": "খ) torquing", "option3": "গ) lateral", "option4": "ঘ) rotation", "answer": "3", "exp": ""}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) Which is not a method of space gaining in orthodontics?", "option1": "ক) expansion", "option2": "খ) extraction", "option3": "গ) rotation of posterior teeth", "option4": "ঘ) proximal stripping", "answer": "3", "exp": ""}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) What is not an indication of amalgum restoration?", "option1": "ক) large class I and class ii restoration", "option2": "খ) post endodontic filling", "option3": "গ) tooth havina fractured cusp", "option4": "ঘ) root and fissure sealing", "answer": "4", "exp": ""}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) Which is not an anterior filling material??", "option1": "ক) glass ionomer cement", "option2": "খ) composite filling", "option3": "গ) light cure filling", "option4": "ঘ) dental amalgam", "answer": "4", "exp": ""}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) Public health stands for-", "option1": "ক) rural health", "option2": "খ) peoples health", "option3": "গ) urban health", "option4": "ঘ) individuals health", "answer": "2", "exp": ""}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) Which is not a function of posterior palatal seal?", "option1": "ক) aids in retention", "option2": "খ) reduces gag reflex